:"连叫四声，这是终于不生我的气啦？","sender":"them","sticker":null,"isSimulated":false},"userId":"uid_1790097193431_hsqqph93y","characterId":"42e461eb-9415-4abe-8c47-ecfdaccd5458","_id":7935},{"id":1794632951862,"text":"我没有说可以作废哦……","sender":"me","time":"12:24","timestamp":1794630244057,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1790097193431_hsqqph93y","characterId":"42e461eb-9415-4abe-8c47-ecfdaccd5458","_id":7936},{"id":1794632951864,"text":"","rawContent":"","isHtml":false,"sticker":"https://i.postimg.cc/yN13xLqH/1773240685461-IMG-3318.jpg","stickerMeaning":"惨兮兮","sender":"them","time":"12:24","timestamp":1794630258519,"roundId":"round_1794630244373_qkxliv0us","generatedMode":false,"hasThinking":true,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790097193431_hsqqph93y","characterId":"42e461eb-9415-4abe-8c47-ecfdaccd5458","_id":7937},{"id":1794632951865,"text":"嘴这么硬呀？那刚才是哪只小可爱在副驾上偷偷连喊我四声陆陆的～","rawContent":"嘴这么硬呀？那刚才是哪只小可爱在副驾上偷偷连喊我四声陆陆的～","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"12:24","timestamp":1794630267331,"roundId":"round_1794630244373_qkxliv0us","generatedMode":false,"replyTo":{"id":1794632951861,"text":"才没有","sender":"me"},"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790097193431_hsqqph93y","characterId":"42e461eb-9415-4abe-8c47-ecfdaccd5458","_id":7938},{"id":1794632951866,"text":"真不作废啊？","rawContent":"真不作废啊？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"12:24","timestamp":1794630269007,"roundId":"round_1794630244373_qkxliv0us","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790097193431_hsqqph93y","characterId":"42e461eb-9415-4abe-8c47-ecfdaccd5458","_id":7939},{"id":1794632951867,"text":"那你不许亲我，也没规定我不许用脸蹭你吧🐶","rawContent":"那你不许亲我，也没规定我不许用脸蹭你吧🐶","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"12:24","timestamp":1794630274660,"roundId":"round_1794630244373_qkxliv0us","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1790097193431_hsqqph93y","characterId":"42e461eb-9415-4abe-8c47-ecfdaccd5458","_id":7940},{"id":1794632951868,"text":"[語音消息]","rawContent":"[語音消息]","isHt